spice
* NMOS Transistors: M1, M2
M1 2 2 1 1 NMOS
M2 4 2 2 2 NMOS

* PMOS Transistor: M3
M3 6 3 3 3 PMOS

* Voltage Sources
VDD 6 0 DC VDD
Vin 2 0 DC Vin

* Node Definitions
* 1 - Ground
* 2 - Common node for M1 source, Vin
* 3 - Common node for M3 source, Vout
* 4 - Common node for M1 drain and M2 source
* 5 - Common node for M2 drain and M3 gate
* 6 - VDD

.end